==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Jar Base (Enemy Base)|Jar Base]].
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shibalien]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[LeMurr]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Ursamajor]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**2 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Aliens here are balanced around ItF completion, so missing even one set of maxed [[Aqua Crystal]]s and [[Plasma Crystal]]s from any chapter will massively inflate their stats. The Darks here are no pushover either, with their own strength magnifications comparable to some early-mid SoL stages. The Elizabeths are especially problematic since the Waves can demolish small meatshields used to stall the Dark pushers and LeMurrs, allowing them to advance unimpeded.

Because most of the threats spawn after base hit, beginners should stall initially and eliminate all the peons to pool resources. The use of a Wave Shield may be necessary to protect attackers unless Elizabeth can be quickly neutralized.

